      "writtenOn": "2022-04-29T04:21:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s.. rather surprising, and troubling. Can you do ~3 runs of each and see if these results are consistent?\n\nIf we find this is indeed a slow computation, we should indeed make this data collection opt-in with a flag. Happy to provide additional guidance with this, but it would be an unfortunate requirement.",
      "parentUuid": "eaf11143_c0eaf633",
      "revId": "9badf5c7b0b3c7f6315f5ec66343ceff0afecbd6",
